      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on some risk assessment profiles for our small business loan department. we're looking at some areas that are seeing a lot of transition right now. can you give me a rundown of what kind of environmental or community factors usually signal that a neighborhood might be becoming unstable or is on the decline for long-term commercial investment? thanks.",
